Something big is brewing for Madhya Pradesh. 🇮🇳

I'm working towards bringing **Web3 CI (Web3 Central India)** to life: a week-long Blockchain & Web3 ecosystem gathering focused on putting Madhya Pradesh on India's emerging technology map.

The vision is to bring together builders, founders, developers, startups, investors, industry leaders, and policymakers for a week of hackathons, workshops, discussions, networking, and innovation.

With a vision to collaborate with the **Government of Madhya Pradesh**, we're aiming to create something meaningful for Central India's Web3 ecosystem.

Not just another event. A movement to build, connect, and grow Web3 in MP.

More soon. 👀

